---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav";
---

<Layout
  title="About QueryLock — Security Through Education"
  description="QueryLock helps people understand cybersecurity before it becomes a problem through practical guides and tailored team training."
>
  <Nav active="about" client:load />
  <main>
    <section class="about-story section section-lg">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-story-content">
          <span class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span>About QueryLock</span>
          <h1>Security Through <span class="gradient-text">Education</span></h1>
          <div class="about-story-text">
            <p>
              After years of seeing the same issues show up in penetration tests, classrooms, and
              everyday conversations, QueryLock was created to close the knowledge gap.
            </p>
            <p>
              Developers were being asked to fix vulnerabilities they were never taught to prevent.
              Teams were being told to follow security rules without understanding why they
              mattered. Beginners were trying to learn cybersecurity, but most explanations started
              too far ahead.
            </p>
            <p>
              QueryLock helps people understand security before it becomes a problem. We create
              practical guides for curious learners and live training for teams that want to write
              secure code from the start, build safer systems, reduce repeat findings, and make
              better security decisions.
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you are learning how the internet works for the first time or helping an
              engineering team improve the way it builds software, the goal is the same: make
              security finally click.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-cta-buttons">
          <a href="/learning" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Explore the Guides</a>
          <a href="/training#contact" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Schedule Training</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
